What?

944
00:41:05,671 --> 00:41:06,672
Damn, lady.

945
00:41:06,755 --> 00:41:08,424
Damn.

946
00:41:11,343 --> 00:41:12,761
So nice to meet you.

947
00:41:12,845 --> 00:41:14,430
My name is Mimina Ito.

948
00:41:14,513 --> 00:41:16,223
- Yeah!
- She's totally different.

949
00:41:16,307 --> 00:41:18,309
- Why are you screaming?
- Woo-hoo!

950
00:41:18,392 --> 00:41:21,353
- Wait, she's so different.
- Now it's getting interesting!

951
00:41:21,437 --> 00:41:22,771
I love it!

952
00:41:22,855 --> 00:41:25,232
- What do you love?
- The action is starting!

953
00:41:25,316 --> 00:41:29,820
Well, I work in Osaka
as a bar hostess in Kitashinchi.

954
00:41:35,868 --> 00:41:38,787
- <i>Oh!</i>
- <i>Come on, girls. Hang in there.</i>

955
00:41:38,871 --> 00:41:41,957
<i>This is the best possible curveball.</i>

956
00:41:50,716 --> 00:41:54,887
Um, my nickname is Mimi,
and I'm very happy to be here. So hello.

957
00:41:54,970 --> 00:41:57,139
- Hello. Good to see you.
- Nice to meet you.

958
00:41:57,223 --> 00:41:58,307
MIMINA ITO, MIMI (29)

959
00:41:58,390 --> 00:42:01,435
I work as a hostess
in a bar in Kitashinchi.

960
00:42:01,519 --> 00:42:04,980
I was consistently the number-one girl
for a little over a year there.

961
00:42:05,064 --> 00:42:07,775
And, yes,
I've been the face of the club ever since.

962
00:42:07,858 --> 00:42:11,195
My father is probably a yakuza.
He has the right tattoos.

963
00:42:11,278 --> 00:42:13,239
I've been beaten up by him a lot.

964
00:42:13,322 --> 00:42:16,909
The police were called.
They got involved a few times, yeah.

965
00:42:16,992 --> 00:42:19,286
I wasn't getting along with my stepfather.

966
00:42:19,370 --> 00:42:22,164
There was no place
I was comfortable calling my home.

967
00:42:22,248 --> 00:42:24,333
So I was thrown into a children's home.

968
00:42:24,416 --> 00:42:25,876
I was always fighting.

969
00:42:25,960 --> 00:42:28,003
I don't usually pick fights, though.

970
00:42:28,087 --> 00:42:30,631
But if someone pushes me, I'll fight back.

971
00:42:30,714 --> 00:42:32,633
- Wow.
- This is so wild right now.

972
00:42:32,716 --> 00:42:34,468
- This is gonna be bad.
- So sick.

973
00:42:34,552 --> 00:42:36,595
- It's feeling dangerous.
- She's not gonna mix with them.

974
00:42:36,679 --> 00:42:38,639
- It's been a while.
- It's been a while.

975
00:42:38,722 --> 00:42:40,057
- How are you?
- What?

976
00:42:40,140 --> 00:42:43,018
- He's a familiar face.
- <i>They know each other?</i>

977
00:42:43,102 --> 00:42:45,521
- I'm used to serving her like a slave.
- No, no, no.

978
00:42:46,313 --> 00:42:47,940
- <i>Uh-oh.</i>
- <i>That's not good.</i>

979
00:42:52,236 --> 00:42:54,488
- Just go home.
- I'm not going home.

980
00:42:54,572 --> 00:42:56,949
- You should. We don't need you here.
- I just got here. No.

981
00:42:59,618 --> 00:43:00,786
Do you want love?

982
00:43:00,869 --> 00:43:03,163
- Mmm… Yeah, I think so.
- Why are you here?

983
00:43:03,247 --> 00:43:05,833
Why? To fall in love.

984
00:43:05,916 --> 00:43:07,543
No, you're not.

985
00:43:07,626 --> 00:43:09,670
- Uh, yeah, I am.
- Don't lie to me.

986
00:43:09,753 --> 00:43:11,839
- I'm not lying.
- What?

987
00:43:18,637 --> 00:43:20,764
- We don't need you. Go home.
- What?

988
00:43:20,848 --> 00:43:22,224
- You go home.
- No.

989
00:43:22,308 --> 00:43:23,934
- Why should I?
- Get the hell out.

990
00:43:24,018 --> 00:43:26,895
- Shut up, ugly.
- Get out. You're the ugly one.

991
00:43:26,979 --> 00:43:29,064
- You're out of control.
- Get out.

992
00:43:29,148 --> 00:43:32,318
- So lame.
- Who is? Don't mess with me.

993
00:43:42,161 --> 00:43:44,496
All right.

994
00:43:44,580 --> 00:43:46,915
- I'm sorry for putting you through that.
- I'm gonna make it.

995
00:43:46,999 --> 00:43:48,375
- I'm so sorry.
- I know.

996
00:43:48,459 --> 00:43:50,044
It happened fast.

997
00:43:50,127 --> 00:43:52,546
But my face looked
just like those guys, right?

998
00:43:54,757 --> 00:43:57,593
- You looked like Tai-chan.
- Exactly like him, right?

999
00:43:57,676 --> 00:44:00,554
- Wow, the best possible plot twist.
- Yeah.

1000
00:44:00,638 --> 00:44:01,680
I love it.
